  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rule of law and accountability for human rights violations in Venezuela</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&apos;s overall objective is to advance effectively the restoration of the rule of law and the independence of the judiciary in Venezuela by strengthening the work of OHCHR and IACHR in the country, as well as capacitating civil society organizations working to engage with international mechanisms that promote the rule of law.</narrative>
  </description>
